"Lady Wu plans to turn the Azure Jade Trading Company against her own family."
"The Wu compound hides a vault and secret rooms, reachable with a spare key."
"Later this year the Lord Governor orders the Wu Clan's arrest and the seizure of its assets."
"Later this year Lord Wu is caught fleeing by ship, after a naval fight sinks two pursuers."
"Later this year the Wu Clan falls to scandal and loses its holdings."
"Ye Shun is the Wu Clan's secret sworn cultivator, kept in luxury as their hidden weapon."
"Ye Shun is at the Fifth Stage of the Initiate's Realm, enough to end most mortal disputes."
"Ye Shun's son is at Third Stage and his grandson at Second Stage of the Initiate's Realm."
"Ye Shun, once an independent, resents the Alliance for squeezing out non-sect cultivators."
"This spring Ye Shun lives at the Wu Clan's side in Pale Moon Lake City."
"Later, after an anonymous talk with Jin in a bar, Ye Shun abandons a plot against the Alliance."
"Later, Ye Shun leaves the Azure Hills eastward with his son, leaving his grandson to study."
